      "collaborative_activity": {
        "title": "Build a Recursive Solution",
        "duration": "5 minutes",
        "description": "In pairs, students design a recursive solution to a simple task, such as printing 'Hello' three times or counting down from a given number. They identify the base case, recursive case, and what changes in each call."
